# Advisories that Trivy reports and that are accepted, with the reason. The same ones, in the same words, are in
# scripts/audit-allowlist.json (the gate of `npm run audit:prod`): drop an entry when its dependency is fixed.

# deepmerge-ts: used by the Prisma CLI to merge prisma.config.ts, a trusted file written by the operator. Fixing it needs
# deepmerge-ts 8 inside Prisma itself.
CVE-2026-40345

# mysql2: only reachable through `prisma dev` (Prisma's local development database). This project uses PostgreSQL and never
# starts it; no MySQL connection is ever made.
